{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "29526675-5c4c-83e5-9bc6-cff42c7d1c18",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T15:32:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Antonio Raposo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:30:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:30:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Antonio Raposo. I am calling about snow plowing. My street has not been plowed since the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:30:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. What street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:30:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am at 67 Broadway, in the North End. The snow was last week, and since then no plow has come down this part of the street. It is still packed down in the middle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:30:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Sixty-seven Broadway. And is it the whole block, or just in front of your house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:30:44-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The whole block, as far as I can see from my window. Cars are driving in the same ruts. Today there is a little new snow, a dusting only, but it is very cold, so everything stays frozen and nothing melts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:31:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, this cold snap isn't helping anybody. The old snow just turns to ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. That is exactly the problem. I would like you to log this, please, so that it is on record that the street was not plowed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:31:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I'm entering it now. Sixty-seven Broadway, North End, street not plowed since last week's storm, packed snow and ice. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:31:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:31:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a callback number on the report, in case the supervisor wants to follow up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:31:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:31:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-five. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:31:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is correct. May I say one thing? I used to work at the old naval station, many years. In those days, the roads there were cleared before anyone came to work. I still miss it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:31:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's a high standard to measure us against. I'll make sure the note goes through to the crew supervisor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:32:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not expect a miracle. I expect the plow to come down the street one time. Do you know when it will be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:32:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It goes onto the list for the next round. Usually that means within a day or so, depending on what else comes up. If the dusting turns into more, they'll be out regardless."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:32:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. A day or so. I will watch from the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:32:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And if it's still not done by Thursday, give us a call back and we'll add to the report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:32:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. Good. Thank you, Miss Arruda."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:32:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Raposo. Stay warm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:32:49-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
